---
// src/pages/tools/touring.astro
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
<title>Touring Across Japan - 47pref.-touring</title>
<style>
  * { box-sizing: border-box; touch-action: manipulation; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 15px 10px 30px;
    background-color: #1a1a1a;
    color: #fff;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
  }
  .nav-header {
    width: 360px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .back-link {
    color: #90caf9;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 13px;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
    padding: 4px 8px;
    border: 1px solid #37474f;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: #212121;
    transition: 0.15s;
  }
  .back-link:hover {
    background: #37474f;
    color: #fff;
  }
  .sound-btn {
    background: #212121;
    color: #fff;
    border: 1px solid #37474f;
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    font-size: 13px;
    cursor: pointer;
    user-select: none;
    transition: 0.15s;
  }
  .sound-btn:hover {
    background: #37474f;
  }
  #game-container {
    position: relative;
    width: 360px;
    height: 600px;
    background-color: #333;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 2px solid #555;
    border-radius: 8px;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
    user-select: none;
  }
  canvas {
    display: block;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .ui-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    top: 10px;
    left: 10px;
    right: 10px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: bold;
    text-shadow: 1px 1px 3px #000;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .controls-guide {
    margin-top: 12px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #aaa;
  }
  .touch-controls {
    display: flex;
    gap: 20px;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }
  .touch-btn {
    width: 110px;
    height: 48px;
    background: #444;
    border: 1px solid #666;
    color: #fff;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: bold;
    user-select: none;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .touch-btn:active {
    background: #666;
  }
  .achievement-section {
    width: 360px;
    margin-top: 24px;
    background: #252525;
    padding: 12px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    border: 1px solid #3d3d3d;
  }
  .achievement-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .pref-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 1fr);
    gap: 4px;
  }
  .pref-badge {
    padding: 6px 2px;
    font-size: 11px;
    text-align: center;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: #383838;
    color: #888;
    border: 1px solid #4a4a4a;
    cursor: pointer;
    user-select: none;
    transition: 0.15s;
  }
  .pref-badge:hover {
    filter: brightness(1.2);
  }
  .pref-badge.cleared {
    background: #1b5e20;
    color: #fff;
    border-color: #4caf50;
    font-weight: bold;
    box-shadow: 0 0 4px rgba(76, 175, 80, 0.4);
  }
  .pref-badge.current {
    outline: 2px solid #ffca28;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="nav-header">
  <a href="/sfsg/tools/" class="back-link">◀ Toolsに戻る</a>
  <button type="button" id="sound-btn" class="sound-btn">🔊 BGM: ON</button>
</div>

<div id="game-container">
  <canvas id="gameCanvas" width="360" height="600"></canvas>
  <div class="ui-overlay">
    <div id="stage-name">STAGE 1: 東京都</div>
    <div id="timer-display">残り: 30.0s</div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="controls-guide">画面の左右タップ または 下部ボタン / [←][→]</div>
<div class="touch-controls">
  <button type="button" class="touch-btn" id="btn-left">◀ 左</button>
  <button type="button" class="touch-btn" id="btn-right">右 ▶</button>
</div>

<div class="achievement-section">
  <div class="achievement-header">
    <span>走破ルート進行状況</span>
    <span><span id="cleared-count">0</span> / 47</span>
  </div>
  <div id="pref-grid" class="pref-grid"></div>
</div>

